	(text "STATUS LEDS: one addressable chain on one GPIO (D0).\nD1 RGB status, D2 CAN, D3 Bluetooth, D4 logging.\nU5 lifts the 3.3 V data to the LED supply level.\nC12-C15: one beside each LED on the board."
